[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4985540559","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121396#issuecomment-4985540559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121396","id":4985540559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKSlPzw","user":{"login":"Mostafa808","id":69848104,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5ODQ4MTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69848104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808","html_url":"https://github.com/Mostafa808","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T21:42:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T21:42:08Z","body":"It is working fine on v4.7.stable.official.\n\nI think you just need to disable `my_plugin` then enable it again through the editor.\nBoth `_enable_plugin()` and `_disable_plugin()` are called when enabling or disabling the plugin through editor or generally using `EditorInterface` singleton. That means every time you make changes to your plugin you must restart the plugin by disabling then enabling it so most of these changes take effect.\n\nThe MRP that was added only has `my_plugin` enabled:\n```ini\n[editor_plugins]\n\nenabled=PackedStringArray(\"res://addons/my_plugin/plugin.cfg\")\n```\nIf you restart the plugin both plugin and its sub-plugin should be enabled:\n```ini\n[editor_plugins]\n\nenabled=PackedStringArray(\"res://addons/my_plugin/my_main_screen_plugin/plugin.cfg\", \"res://addons/my_plugin/plugin.cfg\")\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4985540559/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4988037333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121396#issuecomment-4988037333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121396","id":4988037333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKU9o1Q","user":{"login":"blackears","id":6724608,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjQ2MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6724608?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears","html_url":"https://github.com/blackears","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blackears/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T04:03:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T04:03:37Z","body":"Disablibg and reenabling the plugin fixed it.  Thanks.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4988037333/reaction